 r←Test_DirSelect_005(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;⎕TRAP;rc;startDir
⍝ Exercise the "DirSelect" method on a UNC path as StartDir.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.testMode←1

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.DirSelect.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.posn←45 35
 parms.fixDefaultDrive←0
 parms.info←'We need a directory for the installation of the software:'
 parms.allowCreate←1
 parms.allowRemove←1
 startDir←¯1↓#.FilesAndDirs.GetTempPath
 n←myGuiParms parms #._APLGUI.GUI.DirSelect.Create startDir
 ⎕DL 0.1
 1 ⎕NQ n.Btn_01'Select'
 →GoToTidyUp~0∊⍴n.∆result
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 :Trap 6 ⋄ n.∆CloseForm ⋄ :EndTrap
